  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to democratic reforms, human right mechanisms and rule of law principles in Latin America, Central Asia and Mongolia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;EC/INTPA, through Thematic MIP HR&amp;D, will renew it support to the Venice Commission in its endeavour to improve the RoL and electoral legal frameworks, including political parties legal framework, Constitutional reforms (with specific attention on separation of powers), at the request of Member States or Observing States.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The action will focus on LAC and ASIA but there will be also opportunities to network with the African countries with which the Venice Commission has established preliminary contacts. &lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
